Lineage and acknowledgement

The design of this engine — small, self-contained, composable audio
transformation programs driven directly by a composer — follows the Composers
Desktop Project (https://www.composersdesktop.com), created from 1983 onward by
Trevor Wishart, Richard Dobson, Martin Atkins, Archer Endrich, Richard Orton and
others. No CDP code is included in this repository. The acknowledgement is to the
idea, which we did not originate.

